# ECHO//LINE — Dialogue Resources
# Drop these files into `client/data/dialogues/` after installing Dialogue Manager.
# Each file is a `.dialogue` resource with branches for EN/AR + 3 timelines.

# === File: data/dialogues/past_intro.dialogue ===
~ start
do intro_past_narrate
intro_past_narrate: The wind carries whispers of an ancient era. Stones still hum with forgotten hymns. As the Past player, your foundation shapes all that follows. {PlayerName}, what will you build?
do intro_past_choices
=> Build the foundation of the clock tower > END
=> Tend the gardens of the courtyard > END
=> Inscribe the archive tablet > END

~ intro_past_choices
- The courtyard awaits your touch. Will you lay stone, plant seed, or carve memory?
- The archives yearn for keepers. What story will you preserve in stone?

~ end
do memory_saved
memory_saved: Your choices echo forward. The Present stirs.

# === File: data/dialogues/present_intro.dialogue ===
~ start
do intro_present_narrate
intro_present_narrate: Gears grind against time. The mechanism hums with potential. As the Present player, your actions bridge what was and what will be. {PlayerName}, how will you maintain the link?
do intro_present_choices
=> Repair the clockwork gears > END
=> Replace the broken mechanism > END
=> Calibrate the temporal resonator > END

~ intro_present_choices
- The mechanism shows wear. Each choice reshapes reality. What will you preserve?

~ end
do mechanism_restored
mechanism_restored: Your repair ripples backward. The Past remembers.

# === File: data/dialogues/future_intro.dialogue ===
~ start
do intro_future_narrate
intro_future_narrate: Energy hums in crystallized silence. The future awaits your direction. As the Future player, you channel ancient power into tomorrow's form. {PlayerName}, what will you anchor?
do intro_future_choices
=> Align the quantum flux > END
=> Charge the temporal beacon > END
=> Stabilize the omega anchor > END

~ intro_future_choices
- The threads of possibility await. Your direction shapes what comes.

~ end
do future_anchored
future_anchored: Your anchor completes the triad. Reality stabilizes.

# === File: data/dialogues/tutorial_step_1.dialogue ===
~ start
do tutorial_intro
tutorial_intro: Welcome to ECHO//LINE. You inhabit one of three fractured timelines. Across each, your actions ripple. Together, you must stabilize reality before catastrophe.
do tutorial_choices
=> Continue > tutorial_step_2

~ tutorial_step_2
- Tap any glowing object in your timeline to interact. Watch for ripple effects in other timelines.

~ end
do tutorial_complete
tutorial_complete: You are ready. Find your timeline. Choose your role. Begin.

# === File: data/dialogues/clockmaker_first_meeting.dialogue ===
~ start
do clockmaker_greeting
clockmaker_greeting: Welcome, traveler. The mechanism falters. I am the Clockmaker — keeper of temporal balance. Will you aid me, or watch time unravel?
do clockmaker_choice
=> I will help. Tell me what to do. > END
=> What happens if I refuse? > END
=> Who are you, really? > END

~ clockmaker_choice
- Every choice you make echoes across timelines. Aid me, and reality stabilizes. Refuse, and chaos claims all.

~ end
do clockmaker_grateful
clockmaker_grateful: I knew you would choose wisely. Begin at the courtyard — the Past holds the key.

# === File: data/dialogues/shopkeeper_dialogue.dialogue ===
~ start
do shopkeeper_greeting
shopkeeper_greeting: Shards, traveler? The finest temporal currency in this realm. What catches your eye?
do shopkeeper_offer
=> Show me your shards > END
=> I'll browse later > END

~ shopkeeper_offer
- *displays wares* — Choose wisely. Each shard carries a memory.

~ end
do shopkeeper_thanks
shopkeeper_thanks: A wise purchase. May your timeline endure.

# === File: data/dialogues/recap_outro.dialogue ===
~ start
do recap_narrate
recap_narrate: The echoes have resolved. What began as fractured timelines is now... a single, resonant chord. Your cooperation across eras healed reality.
do recap_continue
=> See the recap > END

~ recap_continue
- Look closely — every choice you made shaped this outcome.

~ end
do recap_farewell
recap_farewell: Until the next temporal breach, traveler. The mechanism rests.
